s, and scrolls, create your own strategies and compete with players worldwide via leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Various Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/9d0f74414ff1fcce796cb5c9550a6112.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" width=604 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/9d0f74414ff1fcce796cb5c9550a6112.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/9d0f74414ff1fcce796cb5c9550a6112.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 'Story Mode' and 'Witch’s Tower Mode'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 165 cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 64 unique monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 32 relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 26 scrolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A leaderboard to compete with players worldwide based on scores </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>■ Strategically Build Your Party and Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2811b9bd370efd2f00ef48bb296deb6a.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" width=604 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2811b9bd370efd2f00ef48bb296deb6a.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2811b9bd370efd2f00ef48bb296deb6a.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp